### Distinction: Verified Sources vs. Unresolved Leads

| Lead / Resource | Status | Grounded Analysis & Verification | Action for P4 |
|---|---|---|---|
| **12 Audited Papers** | **Verified Primary Literature** | Full texts (PDF/XML) retrieved, inspected, and archived in `03_structure/`. | Ready to cite and discuss in manuscript §1.3 and Discussion. |
| **"223 published novel folds"** | **Unresolved Lead** | Appears only in planning notes (`notes/PAPER_STRUCTURE_PROPOSED.md`); no coordinates, citations, or accession tables exist in the repo. | **Do NOT cite or claim in text** until the source paper is named. |
| **ESM Metagenomic Atlas Structure DB** | **Known Reference Boundary** | `highquality_clust30` is a multi-TB structure database not indexed on IBEX. Screen queried AFDB v6 (241M) and PDB (324k). | Maintain explicitly as a stated boundary in Methods M.6. |
| **AlphaFold2/ColabFold MSA Refolding** | **Unexecuted Revision Armour** | A 200-protein pilot exists (`04_structure/pilot_af2/`), but full execution across all $K = 1,031$ has not been run. | Hold as primary revision rebuttal against single-sequence ESMFold critique. |
| **Merizo / Chainsaw Domain Calling** | **Unexecuted Workbench Armour** | Model weights and segmentation pipeline not yet run on IBEX for the 2,838 candidates. | Feasible revision item to turn architectural novelty into an empirical domain count. |
| **Pfam-A 38.2 Search on 4,880 Members** | **Executed & Verified** | Pfam matches a domain in only 8.75% of members and 14.0% of families, covering a median quarter of the chain. | Fully integrated in §1.3. |

